OL,3,GNEWSAExperts identify new apple from
OL,4,Adecades-old tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FKonni Deppe, founder of Luton Orchards,
OL,7,Fsaid it was a "nice addition" to the
OL,8,Ftown's history after the 1958 case of
OL,9,Flocal man Alfred Hull who famously grew
OL,10,Fan apple variety, subsequently named
OL,11,FPam's Delight after his daughter
OL,12,FPamela.
